 - Writes require the `contributor` or `manager` role in the project. Users who can read but not write get 403.
 - Contributors may only modify tasks assigned to themselves, and may not reassign tasks. Managers may modify any task.
 - Only managers may delete tasks.
+- Only managers may change member roles. A role batch is all-or-nothing: if any change fails, nothing changes. Each target must already be a member of the project, and the role must be `manager`, `contributor` or `viewer` (otherwise 400). A member who is assigned any task in the project cannot be changed to `viewer` (409), so no task is left with a non-writer assignee.
